        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-verb-object-separation-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Extend verb-object expressions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "In learned separable expressions, aspect and duration may go between the verb and object. Learn the permitted pattern for each expression.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我睡了三个小时的觉。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ shuì le sān gè xiǎoshí de jiào 。",
                "meaning": "I slept for three hours.",
                "audio": "4748d5595b7ca920015ab73a8e5fd98ede4650944695781ca97966305a5a8622"
              },
              {
                "text": "我和他见了一次面。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ hé tā jiàn le yī cì miàn 。",
                "meaning": "I met him once.",
                "audio": "e081b77e780f2a6ba7345d4d820f4a48c7f9ee97728c1fff59b7a4041f4d24a2"
              },
              {
                "text": "我帮了他一个忙。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bāng le tā yī gè máng 。",
                "meaning": "I did him a favor.",
                "audio": "7426b20b19c2771ec0fd98b18458bb2645de5326eab745fad94c4800734d8e3f"
